{"id":"otlozhit_","lemma":"отложить","pos":"verb","rank":2483,"glosses":["to set aside","to lay by, to save (money for some purchase)","to put off, to delay, to adjourn, to postpone"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ef/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"отложу","2s":"отложишь","3s":"отложит","1p":"отложим","2p":"отложите","3p":"отложат"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"отложи","2p":"отложите"}}},"past":{"m":"отложил","p":"отложили","f":"отложила","n":"отложило"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"откладывать","examples":[{"text":"Давай отложим это решение до завтра.","en":"Let's delay this decision until tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"let's"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"decision"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"until tomorrow"]]},{"text":"Ты не можешь отложить это до завтра?","en":"Can't you put it off until tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"until tomorrow"]]},{"text":"Отложите это для меня.","en":"Lay this aside for me.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Отложи мне эту книгу.","en":"Put that book aside for me.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Мы отложили встречу.","en":"We postponed the meeting.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to meet","l":"встретить"}]}]}